#. module: theater
#: model_terms:event.event,description:theater.event_event_1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em>Shadows of Verona</em> takes Shakespeare’s beloved tragedy and brings it "
"into a gritty, neon-lit future where rival corporations replace feuding "
"families. With immersive staging, original music, and a diverse cast, this "
"reimagining explores themes of loyalty, rebellion, and doomed passion in a "
"world on the brink."
msgstr ""
"<em>Sence Verone</em> prevzamejo Shakespearjevo priljubljeno tragedijo in jo "
"prenesejo v surovo prihodnost, osvetljeno z neonskimi lučmi, kjer sprte "
"družine nadomestijo konkurenčne korporacije. S poglobljeno scenografijo, "
"izvirno glasbo in raznoliko igralsko zasedbo ta nova interpretacija "
"raziskuje teme zvestobe, upora in pogubne strasti v svetu na robu."

#. module: theater
#: model_terms:event.event,description:theater.event_event_3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em>The People Upstairs</em> follows three residents in an old apartment "
"building whose lives intertwine after a tragic loss in their community. "
"Through quiet conversations, missed connections, and unexpected kindness, "
"they confront loneliness, legacy, and the simple need to be heard."
msgstr ""
"<em>Ljudje v zgornjem nadstropju</em> spremljajo tri stanovalce stare "
"stanovanjske hiše, katerih življenja se po tragični izgubi v njihovi "
"skupnosti prepletejo. V tihih pogovorih, zgrešenih stikih in nepričakovani "
"prijaznosti se soočajo z osamljenostjo, zapuščino in preprosto potrebo po "
"tem, da bi bili slišani."

